+    # Preference locks, offered to EVERY board as a ladder and chosen by the
+    # true objective in _seed_free. The old form gated on saturation < 0.6, so
+    # only P3-class boards ever locked anything; P5/P6 got no construction-time
+    # preference mechanism at all. Ranking is by best-minus-SECOND preference,
+    # the value actually lost when a block is displaced -- best-minus-worst
+    # ranks a block that is indifferent between its top two the same as one
+    # that is not, and on P3 it put all 19 regret-carrying blocks outside the
